ption escalation","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned exception escalation. Escalate material cash, security and customer issues on the day detected.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":964761,"criterion_name":"Staff scheduling","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned staff scheduling. Maintain approved coverage for every assigned service shift.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":964762,"criterion_name":"Branch documentation","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned branch documentation. File complete transaction and control records before the next working day.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":964763,"criterion_name":"Complaint resolution","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned complaint resolution. Record action and update customers within the agreed complaint deadline.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":964764,"criterion_name":"Field follow-up","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned field follow-up. Complete assigned branch follow-ups by their approved target dates.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":964765,"criterion_name":"Operating reports","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned operating reports. Submit reconciled branch activity reports by the reporting cutoff.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":964766,"criterion_name":"Security readiness","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned security readiness. Verify assigned alarm, custody and emergency checklists monthly.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":964767,"criterion_name":"Regional performance","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned regional performance. Review monthly branch performance against approved operating targets.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":964768,"criterion_name":"Service improvement","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned service improvement. Implement one measured response to a recurring service issue each quarter.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":964769,"criterion_name":"Operations budget","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned operations budget. Explain monthly controllable cost variances greater than 5%.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":964770,"criterion_name":"Leadership coverage","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned leadership coverage. Maintain documented relief and succession coverage for key branch duties.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":964771,"criterion_name":"Risk governance","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned risk governance. Review and assign corrective action for every high-risk operations exception.","weight":15,"self_rating":2,"rating":2}]','data:image/png;base64,','2026-04-08 09:00:00');
