n, cause, impact and evidence for each finding.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":965075,"criterion_name":"Corrective action follow-up","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned corrective action follow-up. Verify closure evidence for all actions due this quarter.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":965076,"criterion_name":"Report accuracy","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned report accuracy. Issue reports with no unsupported material conclusions.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":965077,"criterion_name":"Confidential records","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned confidential records. Maintain access logs and secure all audit evidence daily.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":965078,"criterion_name":"Fraud indicators","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned fraud indicators. Escalate credible red flags with supporting evidence within 1 working day.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":965079,"criterion_name":"Branch reconciliation","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned branch reconciliation. Reconcile assigned cash and inventory samples without unexplained differences.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":965080,"criterion_name":"Audit coordination","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned audit coordination. Confirm branch schedules at least 5 working days before fieldwork.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":965081,"criterion_name":"Audit plan coverage","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned audit plan coverage. Review quarterly coverage against approved high-risk priorities.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":965082,"criterion_name":"Quality review","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned quality review. Complete documented supervisory checks before each final report.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":965083,"criterion_name":"Stakeholder response","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned stakeholder response. Resolve management clarification requests within 3 working days.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":3},{"score_id":965084,"criterion_name":"Audit resources","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned audit resources. Keep engagement hours within approved budget or document variances.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":965085,"criterion_name":"Control improvement","kpi_description":"Audit Manager I: lead and validate assigned control improvement. Track measurable control improvements after each completed engagement.","weight":15,"self_rating":2,"rating":2}]','data:image/png;base64,','2026-07-08 09:00:00');
