ction on every overdue assigned receivable each week.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":966635,"criterion_name":"Tax schedules","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned tax schedules. Prepare assigned tax schedules at least 3 days before filing deadline.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":966636,"criterion_name":"Expense classification","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned expense classification. Maintain at least 98% accuracy in reviewed expense classifications.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":966637,"criterion_name":"Interbranch balances","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned interbranch balances. Clear or explain every material interbranch difference monthly.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":966638,"criterion_name":"Month-end support","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned month-end support. Complete assigned closing tasks within the approved close timetable.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":2},{"score_id":966639,"criterion_name":"Financial schedules","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned financial schedules. Deliver source-reconciled management schedules by due date.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":966640,"criterion_name":"Financial records","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned financial records. File all assigned financial records with complete reference numbers.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":966641,"criterion_name":"Liquidity planning","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned liquidity planning. Review rolling cash forecasts weekly and explain material gaps.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":966642,"criterion_name":"Financial controls","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned financial controls. Document monthly approval and segregation-of-duty checks.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":966643,"criterion_name":"Budget review","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned budget review. Investigate every department budget variance exceeding 5%.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":966644,"criterion_name":"Risk monitoring","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned risk monitoring. Maintain action plans for every high-risk finance exception.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":966645,"criterion_name":"Team review","kpi_description":"VP for Finance: lead and validate assigned team review. Complete documented review of all material monthly schedules.","weight":15,"self_rating":2,"rating":2}]','data:image/png;base64,','2026-10-08 09:00:00');
