xception escalation","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned exception escalation. Escalate material cash, security and customer issues on the day detected.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":967305,"criterion_name":"Staff scheduling","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned staff scheduling. Maintain approved coverage for every assigned service shift.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":967306,"criterion_name":"Branch documentation","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned branch documentation. File complete transaction and control records before the next working day.","weight":5,"self_rating":2,"rating":3},{"score_id":967307,"criterion_name":"Complaint resolution","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned complaint resolution. Record action and update customers within the agreed complaint deadline.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":2},{"score_id":967308,"criterion_name":"Field follow-up","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned field follow-up. Complete assigned branch follow-ups by their approved target dates.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":967309,"criterion_name":"Operating reports","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned operating reports. Submit reconciled branch activity reports by the reporting cutoff.","weight":5,"self_rating":4,"rating":4},{"score_id":967310,"criterion_name":"Security readiness","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned security readiness. Verify assigned alarm, custody and emergency checklists monthly.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":967311,"criterion_name":"Regional performance","kpi_description":"VP for Operations: lead and validate assigned regional performance. Review monthly branch performance against approved operating targets.","weight":5,"self_rating":3,"rating":3},{"score_id":967312,"crite